对方指向不同菜，就再指一次，而不是连续重复整句。", "role": "assistant"}, {"audio_id": "U09", "content": "吃完要结账和离开，各说哪一句？别给我太多。", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A009.wav", "audio_sha256": "f6f3b96d357354a9af576842b0b3f348c80f4be5bb12fe061fdf78509bbc9cbf", "content": "结账说“Hesap, lütfen”，意思是“请结账”。离开时说“Teşekkür ederim”，就是“谢谢”。这两句在小餐馆也稳妥，不必额外套复杂寒暄。", "frames": 198400, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U09"}
